{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"石鼓洲焚化廠發生三級火警。Chloe Wan ＦＢ\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b392d75a1321fa531f75ddf08275d100/2026-10/c_0_5.jpg\"/><p>今(26日) 衲12時43分，石鼓洲綜合廢物管理設施第1期發生火警，濃煙席捲半空，消防接報到場開喉灌救，至中午1時24分，將火警升為三級火，正出動兩喉兩煙帽隊在場撲救。據悉，焚化廠約900多名員工，坐船離開石鼓洲，暫時沒有傷亡報告。</p><img alt=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads「goblin_under」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f951557f3310749a6bb544ae443a85ec/2026-10/0007bd4d-bf86-48ec-bffb-4ff01697a9c0.jpg\" title=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads「goblin_under」圖片\"/><p>焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads「goblin_under」圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:40:16.743856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:12:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:38:16.982912+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:38:16.982912+00:00","content_hash":"79072db29a945487e7c9f57eea59fe580e38e3175303dd5b07d49e0854b93cc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}